 "code": "def max_subarray(nums: list[int]) -> int:\n    best_here = best = nums[0]\n    for x in nums[1:]:\n        # Extend the current run only if it is still contributing positively.\n        best_here = max(x, best_here + x)\n        best = max(best, best_here)\n    return best\n",
